# 📝 Real-Life Problems

## Problem 1: Calculate Student Total Marks

```go
package main

import "fmt"

func totalMarks(math, science, english int) int {
    return math + science + english
}

func main() {
    total := totalMarks(80, 75, 90)

    fmt.Println("Total Marks =", total)
}
```

---

## Problem 2: Check Voting Eligibility

```go
package main

import "fmt"

func canVote(age int) bool {
    return age >= 18
}

func main() {
    fmt.Println(canVote(20))
}
