# 📊 Types of Functions in Go

| Function Type              | Description                    |
| -------------------------- | ------------------------------ |
| Simple Function            | No parameters, no return value |
| Function with Parameters   | Accepts input values           |
| Function with Return Value | Returns a value                |
| Multiple Return Function   | Returns multiple values        |
| Anonymous Function         | Function without a name        |
| Recursive Function         | Calls itself                   |

